", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Note: Verapamil and digoxin are contraindicated in WPW syndrome.", "runs": [{"text": "Note:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Verapamil"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "digoxin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "contraindicated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "WPW"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "syndrome."}]}, {"id": "body-22006", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Long-term treatment: Teach the patient to perform vagal maneuver’s, Valsalva is the most effective. For infrequent, non– incapacitating symptoms:", "runs": [{"text": "Long-term treatment: ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Teach the patient to perform vagal maneuver’s, Valsalva is the most effective. For infrequent, non–"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "incapacitating symptoms:"}]}, {"id": "body-22007", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "B: atenolol (PO) 50–100mg 24hourly (If asthmatic)", "runs": [{"text": "B:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "atenolol"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "50–100mg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "24hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "asthmatic)"}]}, {"id": "body-22008", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-22009", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "S: verapamil (PO) 80–120mg 8hourly for 24hours (Normal heart)", "runs": [{"text": "S:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "verapamil"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "80–120mg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "8hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "24hours"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Normal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "heart)"}]}, {"id": "body-22011", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Referral: Refer